    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Nephew and childe of Nigel Porter, Sebastian inherited his uncle's alchemical notes and drove himself into a drug-induced psychosis trying to replicate secrets Nigel had deliberately left out of his journals. A gifted but unstable Thaumaturgist, Sebastian serves as New Orleans' unofficial chantry master, though the wider @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.jaYCq9rVOh0I9NCN]{Tremere} clan refuses to recognize the position, deepening his depression and his desperate hunger for the clan's approval. Nigel keeps a close eye on him, using their nightly cribbage games to head off Sebastian's private threats of self-destruction.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Avoid conversation when you can; when forced into it, speak precisely and make sure others know you lead the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.jaYCq9rVOh0I9NCN]{Tremere} in this city.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 5, Dominate 3, Obfuscate 3, Presence 2, Thaumaturgy 4 (Lure of Flames 3, Movement of the Mind 3, Weather Control 2, Spirit Thaumaturgy 2).</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Nigel Porter. Haven: An apartment on Royal Street; maintains a Garden District house as the chantry. Secrets rating: B+.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
